SY_TALK("GjEUJj-AzLo",[[4,["In Sahaja Yoga the Guru puja has a very","different significance"]],[15,["from any other guru puja."]],[23,["When you worship your Guru"]],[28,["you are also worshipping the Guru within","you."]],[40,["This is not in any other guru-disciple","system"]],[51,["because, in you, the Guru, the Master has","been awakened."]],[62,["And so, when you are worshipping your Guru,"]],[68,["then this Master within you is also","worshipped, you respect it,"]],[75,["you glorify it, you awaken it, and you","manifest it."]],[82,["This we have to realise that – in Sahaja","Yoga – if you are a Sahaja Yogi."]],[92,["Now, the quality of Guru, first and","foremost, is that he makes you meet God:"]],[103,["means he raises the Kundalini"]],[108,["and establish the relation between","the All-pervading Power."]],[117,["And as your Guru is Adi Shakti,"]],[120,["you make that person meet, also,","the Adi Shakti."]],[125,["So you have a double advantage that,","at the same time,"]],[130,["when you give them Realisation,"]],[134,["not only that you make them feel the union","with the Divine Power,"]],[141,["but you can make them meet the Divinity","Itself,"]],[145,["the source of Divine Power."]],[149,["So your responsibility, as Sahaja Yogis,","is very great"]],[154,["because in you is there is the Guru."]],[158,["Now in our mantras we say that, “Mother,","I am my own Guru.”"]],[166,["But, saying that, do we realise that:","if I am my own Guru,"]],[174,["this “I” and “my Guru,” between the two,","what have I achieved?"]],[182,["Where am I? Can I guide myself?"]],[187,["Have I got the light of the Spirit on my","attention so well established"]],[192,["and manifested that I can guide myself and","guide others later on?"]],[200,["First of all, in the Guru principle it is","important"]],[205,["that you see to yourself –","the introspection:"]],[210,["Can I be my own Guru? Have I become","my own Guru?"]],[219,["Now, in your case, your Guru is a Mother,","a woman,"]],[227,["so, it has to be among women that","the development of their Guru qualities"]],[239,["have to be very well manifested. But it’s","just the way it is not."]],[247,["For them, they are still the mothers or","they are the wives"]],[250,["or they are Sahaja Yoginis. But they don’t","realise that you are also the Gurus."]],[260,["And, because your Mother is a Guru,","because She is a woman;"]],[264,["and you have to be also of that quality,","that people should say,"]],[269,["“Look at this woman, she’s such a Guru.”"]],[272,["But still, as I hear from the different","leaders"]],[276,["that the ladies are absolutely still very","much far away"]],[281,["and are very few who can be called as real","Sahaja Yoginis."]],[287,["It’s a sad thing to hear."]],[290,["Because if you still keep to all these","mundane things of womanhood"]],[298,["and the drawbacks of womanhood, which has","come out of domination maybe,"]],[304,["because of always they were shown to be","something lower."]],[309,["Specially in the Christian religion they","were never regarded as something holy."]],[316,["They have this kind of a diffidence in them"]],[320,["that they don’t understand that dharma"]],[323,["can be established more by women than","by men."]],[327,["And the Guru’s work is to establish","the dharma –"]],[332,["in the society, in the family, in","relationships."]],[338,["All these Gurus, which are representing","all these great symbols here,"]],[344,["have done nothing but have established","dharma."]],[347,["But, first of all, before establishing","the dharma,"]],[351,["we should watch ourselves – have we got","dharma within ourselves or not?"]],[359,["First of all, the quality of a person who","has dharma"]],[365,["is that he listens to others, he obeys."]],[375,["And this is something [that] has gone wrong","with the Western women, I think,"]],[378,["that they have forgotten how to listen to","others, how to obey others."]],[384,["That’s why their children also don’t obey","them."]],[390,["Obedience, if you do not have, nobody’s","going to obey you."]],[395,["First, you must learn to obey."]],[399,["A person like Kabira, because he was born","of a unknown cast,"]],[408,["people didn’t know what he was born from,"]],[412,["and he could not go directly to any Guru."]],[420,["So, he heard about Ramanand, a great Guru","of those days,"]],[427,["who used to go to the river Ganges every","morning to have his bath."]],[432,["So one day on his steps Kabira kept lying,"]],[438,["and in the darkness the Guru could not see,","and he touched him with his feet."]],[444,["He said, “Who are you?” So he said,","“I’m Kabir,"]],[449,["and I’m your disciple.” And he caught hold","of his feet."]],[454,["And when he caught hold of his feet, he","[Ramanand] said, “Alright, come along!”."]],[458,["And then he became such a great saint","in India."]],[465,["People know him more than they know his","Guru; he became so great."]],[469,["The basic thing is humility."]],[472,["Yesterday you saw how the musician","(Nishat Khan) was humble."]],[476,["All the time he was humble."]],[479,["He didn’t know how to express his humility","every time."]],[482,["All the time he was humble."]],[486,["Because in humility only you can receive","the blessings,"]],[491,["you can receive the quality that is of your","Guru."]],[500,["Now, for a Guru as you have seen"]],[502,["that, in My own way, in My own image,","you have to come up."]],[509,["First of all your life should be absolutely","transparent."]],[513,["Transparency is the essence of Sahaja Yoga."]],[516,["Everybody should know what you are doing,","where you are going,"]],[520,["what is the way you live, what is the way","you are behaving."]],[527,["I have seen people, who are gurus, also","in the sense that we call them leaders,"]],[533,["or we can call them sub-gurus, or they","cannot be called as priest,"]],[536,["but I can say ‘communication centres’","as they are."]],[540,["In them you find that they are very fussy","type of people."]],[548,["Always think about their body, always think","about their comfort,"]],[552,["always grudge about – nobody looked after","them –"]],[555,["as if they suffer from persecution-mania!"]],[560,["Or they will grudge about food, “I didn’t","eat my food for one day!”"]],[564,["Doesn’t matter!"]],[566,["For a Guru it’s better to starve for about","three, four days nicely,"]],[571,["so that you get over this idea of hunger."]],[576,["You’ll be surprised since I’m here I have","not eaten anything much,"]],[580,["and just drinking something, because just","the Guru has no hunger."]],[585,["Because it is in your stomach the Guru,","vibrations, are so much"]],[590,["that you don’t feel like eating anything."]],[593,["So then, what do you eat and how do you","eat and all these things"]],[596,["that we have given up to come to Sahaja","Yoga."]],[599,["So even if leaders have this nonsense","in their head"]],[602,["[like] what do you get to eat! I mean, this","is the basics, absolutely!"]],[608,["And when I hear some people telling Me, oh,","what did they eat"]],[611,["and how did they eat and all! It’s like I","feel they are like tourists in Sahaja Yoga."]],[619,["Just come in Sahaja Yoga like tourists,"]],[622,["you see, to see places and go round"]],[624,["and to know where you get, in what","restaurant, you get good food and cheaply."]],[632,["All this is so basically,"]],[636,["absolutely not a manifestation of Guru","principle."]],[643,["Now you have seen your Guru as She is."]],[647,["I do not know what I eat, what they give","Me, what I want."]],[653,["They go on giving Me whatever they think","I like,"]],[657,["and I just don’t know if I like that thing","or not, or what is it."]],[661,["If they ask Me, “Mother, what will You","have?” I said, “What will I have,"]],[664,["I don’t know really, what will I have?","Anything!”"]],[667,["So there has to be no choices."]],[669,["First of all not to waste your attention","on choices."]],[673,["Of course, only on vibrations."]],[677,["I mean, supposing, you go to a restaurant,"]],[679,["find all kinds of funny vibrations there,"]],[683,["people are getting drunk or anything, then","of course you should say."]],[686,["But all the choices must be based on","vibrations and not on material things."]],[691,["That you get something nice there,","“Let’s go there,”"]],[694,["and they’ll travel for fifty miles to go","eat something nonsensical."]],[700,["It should be all nonsense for all Sahaja","Yogis."]],[703,["And when I said “Sahaja Yogi” it means","also Sahaja Yoginis."]],[707,["So the food part of it is aswadha."]],[711,["You should not have any taste for any","special food."]],[715,["Specially in France to say that people","may not like,"]],[718,["but French are very, very conscientious or","aware about the food part."]],[727,["I don’t know how far they make really","good food,"]],[730,["but at least they think they eat very good","food. Alright."]],[734,["So, the eating of good food is a kind","of an addiction."]],[742,["It’s a kind of an addiction; it’s something","like drug –"]],[745,["that you must have good food."]],[747,["So Zen started this system of what they","call the tea ceremony."]],[753,["In the tea ceremony what they did, I mean,","I have been through that"]],[759,["and it’s really quite a test of people."]],[763,["With Me it was alright, but the rest","of them got really frightened."]],[768,["That in the tea ceremony whatever rituals","they do"]],[771,["they give you a tea, which is so bitter,"]],[775,["and we can say [like] quinine raised","to power 108!"]],[778,["It’s like that. And they give you very","nicely,"]],[781,["handle you with such ritual that you have","to take it."]],[786,["So first they say, “You see the cup without","thinking.”"]],[791,["So he tried to make thoughtless awareness","through the cup."]],[795,["I don’t know how much one can achieve","with that."]],[798,["But that tea if you take once, your tongue","is good for anything."]],[809,["And to compensate it they give you","something sweet,"]],[814,["which is again sweetness raised to power","108,"]],[817,["so sweet that it becomes bitter! So sweet."]],[822,["So this is just to conquer the tongue","[that] Zen must have thought"]],[826,["that better give them this tea ceremony"]],[832,["where there is no tea, there’s nothing"]],[835,["but just you really give such shocks","to your tongue,"]],[840,["so that after that you can eat whatever","you get."]],[844,["And that’s why you must know that Japanese","can eat anything."]],[851,["They have solved their food problem","because they can eat anything!"]],[855,["They can just fish out some crabs or could","be some prawns,"]],[864,["just peel them out like peanuts and eat","them like that."]],[868,["I think Zen has solved this problem","for them,"]],[870,["because they have food shortage and this is","how they can eat everything:"]],[875,["they can eat the bark of the tree, they can","eat the snake,"]],[877,["they can eat the lizards, they can eat","the frogs, everything they can eat."]],[881,["So all their eating problems are solved","in that country by Zen, I think,"]],[887,["because you have no taste."]],[893,["But in this I think the worst are,","in the whole world are Indians."]],[899,["They are the fussiest people for food.","Because their women have spoiled them."]],[904,["They know very good cooking and they know"]],[906,["how to handle their husbands by cooking","very well."]],[909,["And the way they cook food for them,","you see,"]],[911,["the men have to go back to Indian food."]],[914,["Even if they travel the whole world,","they’ll need Indian food,"]],[917,["they can’t get over their tongues."]],[919,["It is such a big conditioning in India","of food"]],[923,["that I just don’t know how will they get","out,"]],[926,["the, absolutely, the basics which are","important."]],[930,["Gandhiji tried that very much in","the ashram."]],[933,["He used to give horrid food, boiled food","with the oil of mustard on top"]],[941,["and then nobody could eat that. Raw!"]],[944,["And he used to make everybody eat that."]],[947,["Not only that, he would make them clean","the bathrooms, WC’s, everything"]],[953,["so that you get rid of your nose also, that","you need everything."]],[956,["Because so many people you will, while","eating also in India"]],[959,["will put something to their noses, and they","smell everything."]],[962,["So they are oversensitive to their tongue","and to their nose."]],[966,["But not to their eyes, to eyes they are","not."]],[969,["For eyes I would say the most sensitive","people are Japanese and Chinese"]],[975,["and also the Western people are very much","sensitive"]],[978,["because they don’t like to see anything","dirty, filthy or ugly."]],[982,["Indians won’t mind any dirt, filth,","anything,"]],[984,["just like dogs and what you call, horses","or buffalos!"]],[992,["They can walk through any dirt, filth –","anything!"]],[995,["Nothing matters to them, anything ugly,","any ugly building"]],[999,["or an ugly dress or anything is alright","for them."]],[1002,["It doesn’t matter, to their eyes it doesn’t","matter at all."]],[1006,["Only thing [is that] kitchen should be clean","and they are all the time in the kitchen."]],[1010,["So we don’t have to learn all these bad","things from Indians."]],[1013,["There are some good things they have, but","there are certain things"]],[1016,["[which] are very bad conditionings."]],[1017,["And the next to that are, I think,","the French."]],[1021,["But if you eat English food you can become","quite good"]],[1024,["because there’s no taste in English food."]],[1039,["So, I have no problem anywhere because","I think I have no taste at all"]],[1045,["and I can eat anything any way it is","cooked, it’s alright,"]],[1048,["I don’t bother about what is cooked, what","is not cooked."]],[1052,["But if you have some French people for","a dinner in a restaurant"]],[1057,["they will spend forty-five minutes deciding","what they are going to eat,"]],[1060,["and what a waste of energy!"]],[1062,["Forty-five minutes just to decide what they","are going to eat!"]],[1065,["After all what is so great, what you are","going to eat? It’s all there."]],[1068,["Just one thing that everybody should have."]],[1070,["So for Sahaja Yogis it’s important to give","up this idea, “I will have this.”"]],[1075,["First of all nobody should ask, “What will","you have?”"]],[1081,["To Me also. I do not like people asking Me","questions [like], “What will You have?”"]],[1086,["Because I’ve to think about it and I want","to be in Nirvichara."]],[1108,["So, this is a, one, big ordeal, which we do","not understand:"]],[1115,["how much we are attached to food. And food","goes in the stomach."]],[1120,["And not only that it spoils our guru","system,"]],[1123,["but also spoils our physical system."]],[1126,["So we should try not to look at food."]],[1130,["That’s why fasting was told to the all","the people"]],[1134,["who wanted to develop their Gurupada,","so that they should not fast."]],[1140,["But they do not fast normally because","they think of food, so there’s no fasting."]],[1147,["I mean, fasting means that you go into","Nirvichara and don’t think of food."]],[1152,["But they are all the time thinking of food,","so it has no meaning"]],[1156,["and you are just the same whether you eat it","or not, your mind is eating it all the time."]],[1160,["Then you start thinking, “When will I end","my fast"]],[1163,["and know where will I go to have what?”"]],[1169,["So this is a very basic thing that we","should get rid"]],[1172,["of our habits, of our conditionings –"]],[1175,["what we are going to have and what food","we are going to have."]],[1179,["Our children also should be given a proper","training about it that –"]],[1185,["it’s alright, sometimes there is no salt,","sometimes there’s no sugar, doesn’t matter."]],[1190,["And sometimes there’s nothing, doesn’t","matter."]],[1192,["Nothing [is] important for a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[1194,["you can live without food for days","together, no problem."]],[1201,["So for a Sahaja Yogi there’s nothing like","taste of food and hunger."]],[1208,["There’s only one hunger is to be purified,","to be clean."]],[1215,["This is one of the things that dirties","our mind, we should say,"]],[1220,["that we think about food all the time."]],[1226,["Even in Russia I found people carried","all Indian things there,"]],[1230,["they were cooking all Indian things, and","I am, poor thing, I can’t eat anything."]],[1235,["So they cooked, brought everything for Me,","thinking I’m an Indian,"]],[1237,["but they don’t know I am Zen – I cannot,","I do not, have sense of taste."]],[1243,["So once, to get over taste one has to work","out."]],[1247,["It’s an experiment we have to do with","ourselves."]],[1250,["Unless and until we introspect ourselves","and do experiments we cannot rise."]],[1256,["Because though the Kundalini is trying","her level best,"]],[1259,["but your conditionings are so great"]],[1261,["that it cannot pierce through and cannot","make you onto that Guru level."]],[1267,["If you see the lives of all these Gurus:","they were married,"]],[1271,["they had children, they lived a normal life"]],[1275,["but in their own personal life they were","absolutely detached people."]],[1281,["So, first detachment should come from food."]],[1287,["And there whatever you like you just","don’t eat."]],[1292,["That’s the best way. Because already","because of liking something…"]],[1294,["supposing if somebody’s fond of ice-cream."]],[1297,["He must have already spoiled his liver;","so then, give [it] up now."]],[1301,["If you like pasta, give up pasta."]],[1305,["If you like something else, just give up,"]],[1307,["don’t ask for it and don’t eat it at all;"]],[1310,["so that, you see, your mind will get little","bit detached from it."]],[1315,["It’s very easy to achieve this detachment,","I think,"]],[1320,["if you work it out in a sensible way. Just","try to punish your body."]],[1327,["You see, if you are your Guru, you better","take hold"]],[1330,["of first of all your body and your","conditionings."]],[1332,["You have to treat your body with this","thing."]],[1335,["I am told many girls who have married","abroad"]],[1338,["are still making their Indian food and","eating that."]],[1340,["It’s horrible it is! They should starve."]],[1343,["If they starve for say about five, six days","or maybe eight days,"]],[1347,["then they’ll eat any food in any case."]],[1351,["That’s why the fasting is given."]],[1353,["So one should adjust oneself to any kind","of food you can have."]],[1358,["And if you want to survive then you eat","anything,"]],[1361,["so just make it a point that you get rid"]],[1364,["of this very simple conditioning you have –"]],[1368,["of liking the food that you want to eat and","you don’t want to have anything else."]],[1373,["I think as Sahaja Yogini or Sahaja Yogi who","cannot get rid of this little thing,"]],[1378,["then how can you call him a Sahaja Yogi?","I don’t know. He’s very asahaj."]],[1382,["Because the other day I met one lady."]],[1385,["I said, “What is the matter, where have","you been?”"]],[1387,["She said, “I have been looking out for some","sort of an Indian ingredient.”"]],[1391,["I said, “How can you get it here in this","Spain? You cannot.” “Why?”"]],[1395,["“Because they asked me to make Indian","food.” “Alright."]],[1398,["Then without that can’t you make Indian","food?"]],[1400,["What is the need to run all the way, whole","day"]],[1402,["for a one small little thing called hing","(asafoetida)?”."]],[1404,["There’s a big name for that, it’s a small","little thing."]],[1407,["Just to get that she had to run all over","the places to get it!"]],[1411,["So for people who are Sahaja Yogis if they","are sahaj,"]],[1416,["whatever is available you can make","something nice out of it and eat it."]],[1423,["So that shows what? It shows sagacity,"]],[1427,["shows trupti (contentment), shows your","satisfaction."]],[1432,["And that is one of the manifestations","of a Guru"]],[1435,["that he’s a satisfied soul."]],[1438,["He’s just self-contained, he doesn’t","bother."]],[1442,["Now, for example, some people, specially","in the West,"]],[1446,["thank God, they are not spoiled by their","wives so much."]],[1449,["They don’t have so much of conditioning,","they can eat anything."]],[1452,["I’ve seen that when they come on the India","tour,"]],[1455,["all the Indians say, “Horrid food was given"]],[1458,["and the poor things were eating that horrid","food and this and that.”"]],[1462,["And I asked them, “Which place you like","the best?”"]],[1465,["They said, “Brahmapuri.” I said, “Eh? They","were saying"]],[1468,["Brahmapuri had the worst food and everybody","is complaining.”"]],[1471,["“No, no. Brahmapuri was the best,"]],[1473,["because we could bathe in the river and we","could sing"]],[1476,["and we could enjoy it!” You see, that’s","the sign of one thing,"]],[1480,["to get rid of your bad habits of food","business."]],[1486,["Now the second part is for the body you","need comforts."]],[1492,["I must congratulate the Western Sahaja","Yogis"]],[1495,["that they may be coming from any walk","of life –"]],[1500,["I must say, the Indians have to learn","from them –"]],[1503,["they may be coming from any position","or status."]],[1507,["All of them enjoy the comfort of the Spirit","when they travel in the Tour."]],[1514,["They do not ask for, “I haven’t got","a chair,"]],[1518,["I haven’t got a bed, I haven’t got a proper","things here.”"]],[1522,["In this way, you see, you will realise"]],[1525,["that the body comfort is of no importance."]],[1531,["It’s, we have just spoilt our body, there’s","no need, no need."]],[1534,["Body you put it anywhere, will sleep","in any case."]],[1537,["If you cannot sleep for two nights,"]],[1540,["alright, put on some music for one night","or two nights"]],[1542,["as we had here, you will sleep anyway!"]],[1557,["So this is the second point is that we have","to give up body comfort."]],[1567,["But the third point where I think","the Western people falter"]],[1572,["is their materialistic attitude.","Materialistic attitude"]],[1577,["and their fondness of their eyes. So one","of them is the worst of all."]],[1584,["I mean, the worst in worst of all is that","you can never have,"]],[1588,["that’s such a big blot if you have that,"]],[1591,["is to have a roving eye and things like","that."]],[1595,["It’s out of question. That’s out of","question for women or for men."]],[1599,["They are not Sahaja Yogis by any chance."]],[1602,["They have to have very clean eyes."]],[1607,["That part is alright."]],[1609,["And the second part is the greed, lust","and greed."]],[1614,["Of course, with Sahaja Yoga maybe the lust","part is over,"]],[1618,["but greed is still there with so many who","get lost."]],[1625,["So I would say Indians do not have this","lust problem,"]],[1629,["but they still have greed, greed problem –","means they want to buy something"]],[1634,["like a radio or some electrical stuff they","must buy."]],[1640,["If they come abroad they must buy","something."]],[1642,["It’s alright, if you get it, well and good,","if they don’t get it, well and good."]],[1646,["It should be [that attitude]. But for","a Westerner, you see,"]],[1649,["he would not like to give up his furniture,","which his great grandmother had it."]],[1654,["Though he can’t sit on it because it’s so","old."]],[1657,["If he sits on it, it will break. But he","must keep it to show off that,"]],[1661,["“I had a great grandmother who gave this","unique chair.”"]],[1664,["According to Indian standards it’s junk!","Absolute junk."]],[1669,["Because it is good for nothing you put it","in the drawing room,"]],[1672,["nobody can sit on it and it looks junky."]],[1675,["But according to the Western mind the older","it is, the better –"]],[1679,["whether it is a junk or anything – he’ll","have so many junks in the house"]],[1682,["and then they will sell like hot cakes."]],[1684,["Because there’s a very subtle materialistic","attitude"]],[1688,["towards matter that, “This will sell like","hot cakes if I sell it”,"]],[1691,["because there must be another mad Westerner","who would like to buy that junk. You see?"]],[1696,["So this junk that you have in the house","it’s better to get rid of,"]],[1701,["because God knows how many people must","have used [it]."]],[1704,["It’s like a grave in the house. It’s","a grave."]],[1707,["So to have then also the antique jewellery."]],[1711,["Antique jewellery is another mad, antique","is a – what you can say –"]],[1718,["is the fad or addiction of the Western","people – antique."]],[1723,["For us nothing is antique because we still","produce antique things, beautiful things"]],[1727,["so Indians don’t understand the value","of antiques."]],[1729,["They don’t understand how these people","are so mad"]],[1733,["after torn things and broken things and","dirty things and filthy things!"]],[1738,["But the Western mind has been brought up","that way."]],[1741,["Now, in these antique things I have seen","that,"]],[1743,["once I went to somebody’s house, you see,"]],[1746,["and he asked Me with very great honour","to sit on his chair."]],[1749,["And as soon as I sat on the chair I thought","there were snakes"]],[1752,["and there were scorpions all biting Me."]],[1755,["I got a fright, I got up. I said, “What","is it?”"]],[1758,["He said, “This is from great, great,","great grandmother, you see,"]],[1761,["she gave us this thing.” I said, “It will","break, I’d better sit outside.”"]],[1767,["So this also madness of this antique","is so much"]],[1770,["that it is unbelievable how people go","into it."]],[1776,["So there’s a joke in India there’s a very","great writer"]],[1781,["called as Premchand, he wrote about two","Englishmen"]],[1785,["going on the road of Benares when they were","hit by a lota (metal pot),"]],[1792,["that they use for their bathrooms, fell","on their feet. And it fell on their feet."]],[1799,["And jokingly he says, “on the feet where","all the bureaucrats fall.”"]],[1805,["Means, all Indian bureaucrats used to fall","at the feet of the English at that time!"]],[1808,["So he made a joke. But doesn’t matter."]],[1811,["Then the English, you see, looked at that","thing"]],[1813,["and they were very angry and immediately","they took to law,"]],[1815,["“You have to come to the courts, you have","to come to the police"]],[1819,["and we’re going to report this has fallen","there, it has hit us,” and all that."]],[1823,["So there was a clever man, he knew","the English or the Western mind,"]],[1828,["he said, “Sir, do you know this, this lota","has very valuable!” He said, “Why?”"]],[1834,["“Because this one was used by Akbar","the Great. So ancient it is”."]],[1839,["He said, “Really?” “Yes it is and, you","know, you just don’t quarrel with them."]],[1844,["And ask them for this lota.” And he told","in Indian language to them that,"]],[1849,["“I have befooled these people, I have told","them that this lota belonged to Akbar"]],[1854,["and you have to take this lota and use this","lota to just to befool them.”"]],[1864,["So then they asked, “But alright, we’ll","forgive you,"]],[1867,["we’ll not take you to any courts or","anything, but you just give us this lota.”"]],[1872,["They said, “No, we can’t.” He said, “Why?”"]],[1874,["“Because it’s such an antique piece,","you see.”"]],[1876,["In India you won’t find anybody respecting","antique pieces,"]],[1879,["especially in Benares nobody bothers."]],[1882,["So they said, “Really?”, “Yes, it belonged","to Akbar"]],[1885,["and, you know, my father was, my","forefathers worked with him,"]],[1889,["so he gave us this lota, we can’t give you,","we are sorry, you see.”"]],[1892,["“No, no, no, no, please give us, you see,","and we’ll no take you to the police.”"]],[1896,["“Alright, you charge us, whatever money","you charge us,” and all that."]],[1899,["In those days they paid one thousand","rupees, you see,"]],[1901,["this is equal to, now, one crore","(10 million), I think."]],[1904,["They gave, these English paid them and","bought that lota,"]],[1907,["which had nothing to do with Akbar or","anyone."]],[1912,["So this madness of antique has to go away","from our minds."]],[1916,["It’s such a built-in thing within us, that","we always talk of antiquities."]],[1922,["Perhaps maybe because of wars everything","was destroyed"]],[1925,["and whatever was in the olden times was","something very beautiful and good"]],[1929,["and now we are not making very good","things, perhaps, maybe that is the reason."]],[1933,["But now we are making nice things, we can","make."]],[1936,["Now in England I was surprised the old","crafts are coming up,"]],[1939,["everywhere I go the old crafts are coming","up."]],[1942,["So to respect antiques means you just","stop making the old craft revive."]],[1949,["Because you pay so much to the antiques,"]],[1951,["the same thing made today won’t fetch","the same price as it was."]],[1956,["Now this has ruined our creativity,"]],[1960,["ruined our handwork and it has ruined our","whole – I think the quality of our life,"]],[1966,["because the way we are mad after antiques."]],[1970,["So this also should go from your head that","anything antique is something good."]],[1976,["It’s a very superficial value – if you see","to it."]],[1980,["Because people think that antique is","something expensive."]],[1983,["It’s just a marketing style that people","have felt"]],[1987,["that this is expensive, that is expensive,","so it’s something great"]],[1991,["to wear something stupid and to say that,","“this is antique jewellery,” and go about."]],[1998,["I mean, God knows how many people must","have used it and must have worn it"]],[2002,["and what must be the feelings of that","person."]],[2005,["So we have to understand that this","conditioning that we have in our heads,"]],[2010,["that we must have something antiques with","us, keep something of such value."]],[2020,["I mean, these questions never arose before,","so it’s not written in any books."]],[2024,["Anyone of the books of the Gurus is not","written that, “Don’t care for antiques.”"]],[2029,["They have written, “Don’t drink, don’t","smoke,”"]],[2033,["all other things which spoils your Nabhi."]],[2036,["They’ve written all these things. But they","have not written"]],[2038,["that, “Don’t worry about antiques so much.”"]],[2041,["You see, and I find that’s a craze nowadays"]],[2044,["and so we have to tell people that we have","to be careful."]],[2048,["Moreover I feel the way people have gone","to drugs and that,"]],[2052,["maybe that because they used so much","antiques"]],[2054,["that the bhoots from the antiques must","have caught them."]],[2057,["Can’t understand that why people are","so melancholy,"]],[2060,["all the time crying, weeping, and all that."]],[2062,["So the conditionings of these matter as","we think it to be"]],[2067,["is to be absolutely taken out."]],[2070,["Of course, I mean in certain countries","we should say"]],[2073,["that the antique things [that] were made","were good and nice."]],[2076,["But, only because something is antique it","should not be respected,"]],[2080,["[but] because of its intrinsic value","of aesthetics, it’s alright."]],[2086,["But one has to see first of all","the vibrations of everything."]],[2091,["If the vibrations are good then you should","accept, otherwise not,"]],[2095,["because we have the language of vibrations"]],[2099,["and we have to use the language","of vibrations."]],[2104,["Once you start using the language","of vibrations you’ll be surprised"]],[2108,["how you will get the complete picture","as to what is to be done."]],[2119,["So to get rid of these three conditionings","too, for our body is very important."]],[2126,["And the worst thing for a Sahaja Yogi [is]","to think that he’s sick:"]],[2133,["is a, sort of a, tarnishing the name","of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2138,["If you still feel you are sick you better","get out of Sahaja Yoga!"]],[2143,["Because either you get well or you are not","a Sahaja Yogi, one of the two things."]],[2150,["If you are a Sahaja Yogi you have to see","that you get well"]],[2153,["and if there are certain problems also –","doesn’t matter."]],[2156,["Now, for example, supposing, I have certain","problems,"]],[2160,["which I know, because of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2163,["because of My position as the Mother,","position as Adi Shakti:"]],[2168,["certain physical things I have to face,"]],[2171,["parasympathetic working I have to face,"]],[2174,["but I go through it! Is accepted."]],[2176,["You have to accept your body as it is","and you are not to sort of say that,"]],[2181,["“I’m not well,” and “There’s something","rong with me,”"]],[2184,["and go on complaining like some old hag!"]],[2188,["Never think you are old, first of all."]],[2191,["Never think that you have gone old or you","are no good."]],[2196,["Look at your Mother. I never think that","way."]],[2198,["Yesterday half of you were sleeping, still","I was alert"]],[2202,["and listening to the music and today I’m","again alert here."]],[2206,["So if you have a Guru then that image","should be with you that:"]],[2210,["“Look at our Mother. She’s so old, how much","She travels, how much She does!”"]],[2215,["Alright, you might say, She’s the Adi","Shakti!"]],[2217,["But little bit of shakti you too have."]],[2219,["And that shakti is to be shown by your","full dynamism."]],[2226,["If you have no dynamism and if you still","feel very weak"]],[2230,["that means you are not a Sahaja Yogi."]],[2232,["So just ask for, ask for any amount of","energy – it can come to you."]],[2238,["That dynamism, it should be there."]],[2240,["Now this I would say, for the physical","self that one has to know"]],[2243,["that you are all younger and getting","younger and younger,"]],[2247,["but not the stupidity of youth, but","gravity, the gravity of the age."]],[2253,["Actually I have seen children who are","born realised,"]],[2258,["they are very grave, they won’t do anything","that is not dignified."]],[2264,["And they will never, I’ve never heard them","talking to some of –"]],[2269,["the Sahaja Yoginis have a bad habit","of talking,"]],[2271,["“tuk, tuk, tuk, tuk, tuk, tuk,” among","themselves."]],[2273,["It’s a very bad habit. Which shows that","they [are] still very much lacking."]],[2278,["Just wearing saris or wearing bindis you do","not become a Sahaja Yogini."]],[2282,["First of all, what is the gravity?"]],[2284,["You should only speak whenever it is","necessary."]],[2287,["So I have seen these Sahaja Yogis who are","born realised children"]],[2292,["they stand like this before Me."]],[2294,["And they say very few words, but beautiful","words they speak."]],[2298,["And say things, which you can remember","all the time."]],[2302,["They just do not go on wasting anything."]],[2306,["And they are extremely obedient."]],[2308,["So from them one can learn that these are","born realised"]],[2311,["and the way their Guru principle is acting,","are we also acting the same way?"]],[2317,["Or we are doing something that is not good","for our ascent?"]],[2321,["So even after coming to Sahaja Yoga if you","do not try hard"]],[2325,["to introspect yourself, you have missed","the point"]],[2327,["that you compare yourself with your Guru –","all the time."]],[2330,["Now. Then everything has to be understood"]],[2335,["in the right perspective that we are Sahaja","Yogis."]],[2339,["Now for a Sahaja Yogi first and foremost","thing"]],[2341,["[is] that he has to have love. First. For","others, not for himself."]],[2347,["If you are all the time worried about","yourself,"]],[2350,["“My body is such, my this thing such, and","I have to do this and that,”"]],[2353,["then you don’t love others. But do you see","to the comfort of others?"]],[2358,["Do you feel the compassion of other","Sahaja Yogis?"]],[2361,["Do you feel, “What have I to bring for","them? What is missing in them?”"]],[2364,["Do you work it out? Do you go out of","the way to help them?"]],[2371,["First of all Sahaja Yogis. Now Sahaja","Yogis are different things."]],[2377,["I have seen many Sahaja Yogis will go and","take the side of the non-Sahaja Yogis"]],[2381,["and try to debase the Sahaja Yogis.","Is a very wrong thing."]],[2385,["You belong to this new race"]],[2388,["and the people who do not belong to this","new race and if they are attacking anybody:"]],[2393,["these are your hands, your feet, your head,","and if they attack it,"]],[2397,["it is duty bound that you help them instead","of helping the others."]],[2402,["Maybe something wrong with this person,","doesn’t matter."]],[2405,["You need not show all the fair play there."]],[2408,["In that place you should support a Sahaja","Yogi out and out."]],[2411,["Later on you may correct and you may","tell that person,"]],[2415,["“You should not have done like this,","it was wrong.”"]],[2418,["So this dignity and this understanding","comes only through silence."]],[2423,["But if you are chirping all the time,","talking “tuktuk, tuktuk, tuktuk, tuktuk,”"]],[2428,["it can never, never can make you a deeper","person."]],[2432,["You’ll be just flying in the air with","all that."]],[2435,["So for women now is best is to take","to mauna,"]],[2438,["is to keep quiet, just keep quiet."]],[2441,["They all the time want to talk."]],[2443,["This I’ve heard from all the leaders that","it’s a big problem with women."]],[2448,["They just go on talking stories, telling","stories."]],[2451,["But if you ask them to come and speak,","they will start shaking."]],[2458,["How many can give speeches? Women?"]],[2463,["If you understand that if you cannot give","a speech, you better not talk also."]],[2471,["You should be able to give a speech because","your Mother is a woman, She gives speeches."]],[2476,["Why can’t you give some speech? You cannot."]],[2478,["If I make you stand here, you’ll be","shaking, I know that."]],[2481,["But if it comes to murmuring souls, you","are there."]],[2485,["So that is one thing women have to be very","careful [about]."]],[2487,["And as today is the Guru puja I have","to tell you things,"]],[2490,["not as a Mother but as your Guru."]],[2493,["That, if you have to ascend the best thing","is for you to stop talking."]],[2498,["“Maunam sarvartha sadhanam.” ‘Maun’ means","to keep quiet."]],[2502,["It gives you all kinds of facilities, just","keep quiet."]],[2509,["If somebody’s talking too much, just keep","quiet."]],[2512,["If somebody’s trying to criticise, keep","quiet."]],[2515,["That’s your silence, that’s your right,"]],[2517,["that’s your domain that you can keep","silent."]],[2521,["Just watch that person."]],[2523,["If it comes then to answer, then you can","answer better."]],[2527,["But if somebody’s trying to attack, you","just keep silent."]],[2532,["But this silence has to be established"]],[2535,["and one should only establish by not","talking too much."]],[2539,["I have seen also when I am sitting here, I","have seen women talking among themselves,"]],[2543,["and this is very wrong. You must learn","the silence."]],[2547,["Like yesterday I saw so many ladies also","were walking out, walking in."]],[2551,["In the church will you do that? You won’t","do it."]],[2555,["In the church there is no Christ, there’s","a horrible priest sitting there"]],[2559,["but you cannot do it. You all keep quiet,","you sit there nicely."]],[2563,["I’ve never seen anybody walking out here","and there"]],[2566,["and doing all kinds of things, putting","the children in front like that,"]],[2570,["making them sleep. Never! Can you do that","in the church?"]],[2576,["What a discipline people observe in that","church, which is an artificial place."]],[2581,["And where you are now, that kind of","a silence has to be there"]],[2586,["and that kind of understanding, that depth,","that awe has to be there."]],[2590,["But because we have not yet developed","that Guru thing."]],[2592,["If you have developed it then immediately","it will work out."]],[2595,["You will see your gravity will show in your","behaviour."]],[2600,["So this is for our attention not to be","wasted."]],[2613,["To discuss somebody, to discuss about","others’ characters, we have no business."]],[2617,["Do we discuss the character of one hand","to another hand?"]],[2621,["To discuss about what has happened about","marriages, things like that."]],[2625,["Also marriage is just… in Sahaja Yoga it’s","not such an important thing."]],[2630,["Some people pay too much attention","to marriage, you see,"]],[2632,["and marriage becomes a headache. Also","then, “What about my marriage?”"]],[2636,["Then again ten minutes you see that person,","“What about my marriage?”"]],[2639,["Again after ten minutes, “What about","my marriage?”"]],[2641,["You want to run away. I mean, you see,"]],[2644,["it’s something becomes like a mania for","people, “What should we do?”"]],[2648,["And the whole thing is, all depends, and","the whole programming"]],[2651,["depends on how you are going to get","married."]],[2654,["So you have come to Sahaja Yoga, you","are sanyasis."]],[2661,["You are not married people in a way."]],[2664,["You are married only to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2666,["that’s your husband, that’s your wife."]],[2669,["And the so-called husband and wife are","there."]],[2673,["But if they are not Sahaja Yogis then you","are unmarried, definitely."]],[2677,["So too much attention is paid in Sahaja","Yoga to marriages."]],[2681,["I have seen that before, marriage, before","Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2687,["marriage was a joke; every third day there","was a divorce"]],[2691,["and people would run away and do all kinds","of things."]],[2695,["Then when they got married after Sahaja","Yoga"]],[2700,["they are the greatest romantic people ever","known in the whole world!"]],[2703,["I mean, all ‘Romeo, Juliets’ going about.","I just don’t understand."]],[2707,["Even in the Indian villages people complain","that,"]],[2709,["“What sort of these people are? I mean,","they have no sense at all"]],[2712,["and the way they go round, are they","the saints?”"]],[2715,["So that saintliness, that sanyasta, that","asceticism"]],[2722,["has to be expressed in our married life."]],[2725,["I don’t mean that you don’t have","relationship with your husband"]],[2728,["but in a very private way. It’s has to be","extremely private"]],[2733,["and it should not be such a great thing","to go into romanticism."]],[2738,["You’ll ruin the whole of Sahaja Yoga in the","West if you start doing that nonsense!"]],[2742,["Because also there’s an idea about it that,","you see, you fall in love."]],[2749,["But then you’ll fall! That’s the first","point is."]],[2751,["You will fall [but] you want to rise."]],[2753,["So this attachment and this worry about","the husband and this and that,"]],[2758,["I mean, you can carry on with any kind of a","husband and wife if you are a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[2762,["should be able to. I mean, I know that’s","very simple."]],[2766,["It’s a… your husband is a study, wife is","a study, that’s all."]],[2769,["You study a person, what sort of a person","he is."]],[2772,["But for that you have to have the witness","state"]],[2774,["and you have to see, you have to be","detached."]],[2776,["So in marriages one has to be detached."]],[2780,["But, on the contrary, I find that just","after the marriage"]],[2784,["they want to organise some special thing","for them"]],[2787,["to go to some sort of a honeymoon or some","sort of a thing!"]],[2793,["I don’t know how these ideas crawl up."]],[2795,["These are coming from the old conditionings","of things"]],[2798,["and after honeymoon they come and say,"]],[2800,["“Mother, this marriage is not going","to work out.”"]],[2802,["So it’s better to do slow and steady and","then decide."]],[2806,["Because you just jump into honeymoon mood","and come back and say,"]],[2810,["“Mother, this, I have started thinking and","I don’t think.”"]],[2814,["I know of a lady who was jumping with","a Indian gentleman"]],[2818,["and she was on her way to Australia. In","Singapore, she telephones that,"]],[2822,["“Mother, I don’t think this marriage will","work out.”"]],[2825,["And here everybody complained to Me,","“Mother,"]],[2827,["these two are behaving in such a manner","that Indians are rather embarrassed.”"]],[2833,["So the sense of shame you must learn","from Indians."]],[2836,["They’d never… husband and wife never sit","together in India"]],[2841,["is regarded as bad manners and it should","be with you also."]],[2844,["That, even in the puja, even in anything","they are sitting in the public."]],[2849,["What is the need to show your relationship","in the public?"]],[2853,["It’s only in the private. This is one","of the things one,"]],[2856,["if you start understanding, there will be","a proper adjustment."]],[2860,["Men should be with men in the public,"]],[2864,["women should be with the women together."]],[2868,["But the women or men, whatever they are"]],[2871,["whatever are their bad, bad points should","not be brought back."]],[2877,["Like, I would say the men have jealousies","and they have power orientation"]],[2885,["and they discuss about leadership and they,","every, they get a shock"]],[2890,["if you tell them that you are not going","to be a leader,"]],[2892,["as if they think leadership is something","very concrete."]],[2896,["It’s the greatest myth ever going, is this","leadership!"]],[2900,["There’s nothing like leaders in this Sahaja","Yoga, it’s just a joke."]],[2905,["And your Mother is very good at playing","serious jokes."]],[2908,["So be careful! Don’t be childish about it."]],[2913,["You have to understand that this is a big","joke going on"]],[2916,["and it’s just a testing point and if I test","you wrong,"]],[2922,["you can tell Me, but I think this has","worked well,"]],[2924,["because I can test people very well on that","level"]],[2927,["and immediately I know when the person","gets onto the horse of ego."]],[2931,["So, for your mental attitude, has to be","different"]],[2937,["and our priorities have to change."]],[2940,["Our priorities have to change. What are","our priorities?"]],[2943,["First and foremost thing is our ascent, is","the first priority."]],[2949,["For our ascent whatever is needed has to be","done."]],[2951,["If you have to punish your body, alright."]],[2954,["If you have to punish yourself, alright."]],[2956,["If you have a conditioning, get rid of it.","Just introspect yourself,"]],[2963,["that is Self-realisation, is to know your","Self."]],[2966,["When you know your Self and know"]],[2968,["what is clinging onto it, just to remove it","completely."]],[2973,["Work it out the way you like. Work it out","the way you like."]],[2976,["You see, it is very important that","the body, mind,"]],[2987,["everything should be your slaves."]],[2992,["Nothing should dominate you. You should be","on top of everything."]],[2997,["How dare your body ask for anything?"]],[3000,["How dare your mind tells you anything?"]],[3003,["How this conditioning works on you?"]],[3005,["“I am a Sahaja Yogi, I’m above everything.”"]],[3008,["Like the lotuses have come out of the","ponds, you have come out of it."]],[3013,["We have so many proofs to show that you","are realised souls."]],[3019,["I’ll show you some photographs that I have","to show that there is light."]],[3024,["I can put light into you, they are all","enlightened people."]],[3027,["But in My presence if you become the light,"]],[3029,["you must carry the light outside."]],[3031,["Not only in My presence, but when you go","out."]],[3034,["But one of the reasons, I think, when I","tell something people just start thinking"]],[3039,["about whom Mother is talking, they never","think, “She is talking about me."]],[3043,["That’s the only way you can penetrate","within yourself"]],[3046,["when you see that, “Mother is talking","about me,"]],[3049,["She’s correcting me all alone and She’s","telling me.”"]],[3052,["Then only it will penetrate and it will","work out."]],[3056,["The priorities have to be changed and","the first and foremost"]],[3060,["is your ascent and the Spirit and Sahaja","Yoga."]],[3064,["The rest is negligible, nothing important."]],[3071,["Then the faith that there is this","All-pervading Power,"]],[3079,["which is looking after us, is very","important."]],[3083,["This time the musicians came all the way."]],[3085,["I must tell you the story of their travel."]],[3087,["They came and they said that there’s","a train from Kiev"]],[3091,["and they also bought the tickets so got","into the train"]],[3094,["and they were off-loaded before","the Hungarian border."]],[3099,["They didn’t know what to do, they had","no visas, nothing"]],[3103,["and not so much money also. They thought,","“We are on the train.”"]],[3106,["They said, “No, you have to go cross over"]],[3108,["and go to Budapest,” and they didn’t","know where,"]],[3110,["they were standing on the road. And,","but they were all laughing"]],[3114,["and enjoying, “must be something in store","for us.”"]],[3117,["Nobody felt that they were in trouble","or in anything."]],[3120,["So surrendered. “So, suddenly,” they said,"]],[3123,["“the custom people came and surrounded","them,” and they said,"]],[3125,["“What’s the matter, how are you here","with all these bags and baggage?”"]],[3130,["So they said, “Why are you here?” They","said, “We have come for a concert and this,"]],[3134,["and musicians we are and all.” And some","or other they started melting away."]],[3138,["And then they gave them Realisation!"]],[3140,["Six of them got Realisation. Now can you","believe: the power of love."]],[3145,["And the custom officers they offered their","own cars, took them down to the other side."]],[3151,["It’s never happened with custom officers!","Imagine!"]],[3153,["It would be like shaving their teeth off,","I tell you,"]],[3157,["the way if you can do that to the custom","officer! But it happened."]],[3164,["And they came to the other side and left","them there."]],[3167,["Now they didn’t know what to do. They","wanted to go to Budapest,"]],[3169,["they had to walk about two miles or","something to the station."]],[3173,["So they were waiting there well, they","said that, “Mother, You sent maybe,"]],[3178,["two Yugoslavs came in a big bus of 49","people – all vacant.”"]],[3184,["They stopped the bus and said, “What is it,","why are you here?”"]],[3187,["So they said, “This is our problem and we","have to go.”"]],[3190,["So they got into the bus. When he was","driving them down,"]],[3193,["they thought of talking to him that, “Why","not you take us to Milan?”"]],[3197,["And they managed!"]],[3201,["And they were in Milan. It’s so remarkable."]],[3205,["So to have faith completely in yourself"]],[3209,["and in that Power, which is surrounding","you."]],[3213,["And once you have that faith you will","realise that,"]],[3217,["that, though it is so helpful to you, it is","so kind to you,"]],[3222,["on the same level if you think it, it can","be very harmful."]],[3230,["So then never listen to the Guruninda,"]],[3235,["means anybody talks anything ill about","your Guru,"]],[3238,["just put your hands to your ears,","absolutely, immediately."]],[3243,["I have known of a person who did that","[and] got cancer,"]],[3246,["another now in jail, another one there."]],[3248,["So anybody is saying like that just put","your hands."]],[3252,["Because now you know that – what is your","Guru."]],[3256,["So you should never hear anything against","your Guru from anyone."]],[3262,["The other day one gentleman asked Me","a question, a newsman."]],[3265,["He said that, “I am told you have made","a castle for Yourself.”"]],[3269,["I said, “I have paid for it, I have made it","also."]],[3271,["It was a horrid place, no doubt. But there","are only Sahaja Yogis staying there,"]],[3275,["I am not staying there. That’s the best","part.” But that’s all I said."]],[3279,["But on the contrary, they never go and ask","these questions to any gurus on anything."]],[3284,["Because the disciples say, “Yes, so what?","We want to give"]],[3287,["to our guru money and this and that.”","They never ask."]],[3290,["But, through Sahaja Yoga, or [by] Myself,","have cured"]],[3294,["so many people of incurable diseases –","I could have minted money."]],[3298,["For curing one cancer patient I could have","made a castle, Myself."]],[3303,["So when people say like that you should","say,"]],[3305,["“Do you know how many people She has","cured? How much money She could have taken"]],[3309,["from them if She was a doctor or She was","a false guru?"]],[3315,["How much money She would have made","out of all of them?”"]],[3318,["Then they will understand. You see, because","they are being"]],[3321,["materialistic they talk like that. And","their attitude is very different"]],[3326,["and so, to tell them off is the best way."]],[3329,["Because I have seen that these press people","are absolutely harassed"]],[3334,["by the disciples of the false Gurus. Just","they cannot criticise,"]],[3339,["they cannot say a word against such","false Gurus."]],[3342,["While I find that Sahaja Yogis still lack"]],[3345,["that complete faith in themselves and","complete assertion."]],[3351,["Where you have to assert you must assert."]],[3355,["For example, anybody says something wrong","against Me, you have to assert;"]],[3360,["must say, “No, not possible. It’s not!” But","I have seen some people"]],[3365,["asking Me funny questions who are ‘Sahaja","Yogis’ also!"]],[3368,["So the first part is that to see how much","we are sensitive to spirituality."]],[3377,["I have seen Sahaja Yogis supporting","somebody who is so negative,"]],[3380,["you can’t even bear that person and, [to","them], such a person is something great,"]],[3386,["while somebody who is so good they cannot","make it out."]],[3390,["So what’s the use? Your computer is so","faulty, you’ll do…"]],[3393,["I mean, the planes will have to run up","and down"]],[3395,["if you have such a computer as Sahaja","Yogis are!"]],[3398,["Because they just judge the other way","round."]],[3401,["A person who is good in Sahaja Yoga, who","has got vibrations,"]],[3405,["he may be simple, he may be unassuming,"]],[3407,["he may not be so rich, he may not be","so educated,"]],[3410,["may not be from some good universities","or anything,"]],[3414,["but you must see the vibrations of that","person!"]],[3417,["What sort of vibrations that person has,","and then you should judge."]],[3421,["Instead of that if you judge that person","only because he’s very good to talk"]],[3426,["and he talks well and very scholarly or","something like that, that’s not the point."]],[3431,["The point is what are his vibrations! And","once you see those vibrations"]],[3434,["and judge them on vibrations, then you are","a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[3438,["otherwise I would not call you at all","a Sahaja Yogi."]],[3441,["But for a Guru it is very important.","I have seen sometimes"]],[3444,["even the leaders supporting somebody","who is absolutely horrid!"]],[3449,["I can’t bear that person even for five","minutes!"]],[3452,["But here the guru sends him over to Me,"]],[3454,["“Oh, Mother, he’s so good, you know, he","donated so much money.”"]],[3459,["It doesn’t matter. You donated money,","so what?"]],[3462,["Who asked him to donate money?"]],[3464,["But he should not donate his bhoots to us","now anymore!"]],[3467,["We don’t want his bhoot! So that’s what","it is."]],[3470,["So the judgment should be correct about","a person"]],[3473,["when you say that this man is not good","or that is not good."]],[3477,["But mostly ‘gurus’ themselves are caught up"]],[3480,["and then they are ambitious and if somebody","doesn’t listen to them"]],[3485,["or somebody wants to give a lecture","at a wrong time and somebody says,"]],[3488,["“You shouldn’t talk like this,” or","something, then they get angry."]],[3492,["They are very hot tempered and they provoke","people, they say things sometimes."]],[3496,["And then when people react they say,","“You are a bad Sahaja Yogi.”"]],[3500,["That’s not the way. First of all a guru","or a leader"]],[3503,["has to be himself a very mild, gentle, and","a good person."]],[3510,["He has to be in such a way [that] he should","not demand anything,"]],[3513,["should not ask for anything. Never demand","anything!"]],[3516,["Anybody who demands cannot be a guru."]],[3521,["Respect is to be commanded and not","to be demanded."]],[3525,["And so, everything works out well if you","understand that –"]],[3531,["once you rise in your ascent, in your","wisdom,"]],[3535,["in your awareness and in your Spirit –","automatically all these things happen!"]],[3540,["You don’t have to ask for anything, you","don’t have to plead for anything,"]],[3544,["you don’t have to complain for anything,","everything works out."]],[3547,["You are looked after by all the ganas,","by all the angels."]],[3551,["They are there. You are on the stage."]],[3554,["But if you are halfway then they play","tricks with you."]],[3556,["You see, they play tricks, they make you","falter, you have problems,"]],[3560,["you go here, you go there, all these","things happen"]],[3564,["and then you say, “Mother, how is it","this happened?”"]],[3566,["Because they are also jokers, so they play","jokes with you"]],[3570,["and they make problems for you just to make","you understand that you are doing wrong."]],[3575,["So we are on a stage where there’s","a beautiful security,"]],[3580,["everything is there and we have to give","to the world"]],[3584,["such a great thing like Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3586,["which is for the emancipation of the whole","world, as you realise,"]],[3590,["and so also I hope you realise your","responsibilities."]],[3593,["There are so many things one has to","understand, how one has to be as a guru,"]],[3598,["how he has to act and how he has to work","out."]],[3601,["Now I have given so many lectures","on Guru things,"]],[3604,["but, for today’s lecture, only I have","to say"]],[3608,["that, first thing, to have a guru system,"]],[3613,["you must have complete humility."]],[3616,["Now, with Me, I would say, I am too simple"]],[3621,["and I am Mahamaya, so you be very careful."]],[3625,["You cannot take liberties with Me. You","cannot take."]],[3630,["If you try to take too much liberties that","means you are not a disciple."]],[3635,["A disciple has to keep a distance from","the Guru."]],[3639,["You cannot just take liberties, walk into","My room every time,"]],[3642,["sit there for hours together, chit-chat","with Me – nothing!"]],[3645,["You have no right."]],[3647,["Only when I call you, when I ask for you,","you should come."]],[3653,["Then you should not force things on","the Guru that,"]],[3656,["“Please, come and listen to this,” or,","“Do this!” that should not be said."]],[3661,["For example, yesterday nobody told Me there","are going to be"]],[3664,["these music programs or everything","arranged."]],[3666,["So you have to report everything to your","leader, or to Me,"]],[3671,["all those things that you want to do.","And it should be really transparent."]],[3675,["Like this hand knows everything that this","hand is doing,"]],[3678,["and this hand knows everything that this","hand is doing."]],[3680,["In the same way everybody should know","each other."]],[3683,["Then the gurus should not have jealousies","for each other."]],[3689,["This I’m just telling you because also","I found out"]],[3693,["that there are certain jealousies. And when","they talk there is a little bit of,"]],[3697,["“Ha, he’s good, but this, this, this.”"]],[3701,["When they enjoy each other’s company"]],[3704,["because they have reached a certain state"]],[3706,["and they understand, “This is the state","we are in.”"]],[3708,["When they enjoy each other’s company fully","and appreciate each other"]],[3713,["much more than anybody else – the guru’s","company."]],[3718,["All the company of the leaders, if they","enjoy each other"]],[3725,["and there’s no jealousy, there’s no fight,","there’s no problem"]],[3729,["but just the enjoyment of the company,"]],[3731,["then they should know that they have","become a guru."]],[3734,["Now all of them never fought with each","other. They supported."]],[3737,["Actually it is one Principle was born again","and again."]],[3741,["But only the satanic people – they’ll fight","among themselves, not the godly."]],[3747,["And also they will talk against the person","who is a realised soul"]],[3752,["or who is an Incarnation, but never","against themselves."]],[3756,["It’s very surprising that the satanic","people,"]],[3760,["though they fight among themselves, there","are jealousies,"]],[3762,["they’ll never talk of each other."]],[3765,["But here I find that in Sahaja Yoga we","have freedom."]],[3768,["But freedom is not abandonment,","is the freedom"]],[3771,["with complete rules and regulations","of the Divine, with us,"]],[3774,["and we have to know them that this is","the Divine Law."]],[3779,["So all of us are now sitting like in a big","vimana, like an aeroplane,"]],[3785,["and we all have to land into the beautiful","area."]],[3788,["But first of all we have to develop that","humility in your heart;"]],[3795,["complete humility and surrender, that’s","very important."]],[3798,["Unless and until you have that humility","and surrender in your heart,"]],[3802,["Guru principle cannot be awakened."]],[3805,["First you have to be the disciple and then","the guru."]],[3809,["So you have to develop that humility."]],[3812,["And that humility comes very easily if","you love Me, respect Me."]],[3819,["It’s not only love, but respect."]],[3823,["That respect has to be there and then","people will respect you."]],[3830,["May God bless you."]]]);
